This parameter is required.', example='ecd-xxxx'),
  runtimeType?: string(name='RuntimeType', description='The agent runtime type.

This parameter is required.', example='CloudDesktop'),
  smartModel?: boolean(name='SmartModel', description='The smart model filter. Valid values:
- true: Queries the system wuying-preset provider models based on the business type of the runtime.
- false: Excludes wuying-preset from the effective configuration.
- Not specified: Returns both smart and non-smart models in the effective configuration.
